{"id":"steam-1351790","steam":1351790,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"Hegemony III: Isle of Giants","summary":"The second official expansion for Hegemony III adds the megalithic builders of the mysterious Nuragic civilization to compete with the Romans, Greeks and Gauls for control of ancient Italy.  The largest map expansion yet includes dozens of new cities, factions and units.","about":"Centuries before the founding of Rome, the Nuragic tribes of Sardinia were building thousands of monumental fortresses, tombs and statues across their rugged Mediterranean island. In the second official expansion for Hegemony III, play as any of a dozen new factions of the mysterious Nuragic civilization to unite the islands of Sardinia and Corsica and compete for dominance of the ancient world against the Roman, Greek and Gallic factions of the mainland.\r\n\r\nNote: This expansion requires both Hegemony III: Clash of the Ancients and the first expansion Hegemony III: The Eagle King\r\n\r\n\nExpanded Map\n\r\nThe largest map expansion yet adds the islands of Sardinia and Corsica with dozens of new cities to Hegemony III's seamless map of the ancient Italian peninsula.\r\n\r\n\nNew Civilization\n\r\nAdds a dozen new factions of the Nuragic civilization with new architecture, units, skills and upgrades.\r\n\r\n\nMore details coming soon ...","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351790/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1608092416","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351790/header.jpg?t=1608092416","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351790/header.jpg?t=1608092416","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351790/ss_89e67bb8d1d19f90e009a88ed4be28ca0683adaa.600x338.jpg?t=1608092416","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1351790/ss_89e67bb8d1d19f90e